OL,3,GNEWSAMan in his 80s dies in Wood Green
OL,4,Ahouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 80s has died in a house
OL,7,Ffire in north London.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,10,Fterraced property in Granville Road,
OL,11,FWood Green, at 22:15 BST on Saturday.
OL,13,FThe London Fire Brigade (LFB) said one
OL,14,Fwoman left the house before the brigade
OL,15,Farrived, but the man died at the scene.
OL,17,FThe first floor and half of the roof of
OL,18,Fthe two-storey building was destroyed,
OL,19,Fthe brigade said. The cause of the
OL,20,Fblaze, which was brought under control
OL,21,Fby 23:30, is being investigated by the
OL,22,FMetropolitan Police and LFB.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
